msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"(That's the kid from before. Looks like he still hasn't\r\n"
"found his mom.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "My... *sniffle* My balloon... flew away..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "So if you've got that red balloon, your mom can find you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"She promised that, as long as I had the red balloon, she'd\r\n"
"come and get me. And she's never broken a promise before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "(So he needs his red balloon to reunite with his mother...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Forget about that balloon already. It's long gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "No... It can't be..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Waauhhh... *sniffle* Mommy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "You got 8,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"All right. I'll tell you what, I'll get that balloon for you\r\n"
"if you dry those tears and stay strong. Can you do that for\r\n"
"me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "*sniffle* Okay... You really think you can find my balloon, mister?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"You bet. Wait right here and I'll get it back to you in\r\n"
"no time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"Control the camera with "
"the<Action:Turn_Camera_Up@Adventure><Action:Turn_Camera_"
"Down@Adventure><Action:Turn_Camera_Left@Adventure><Action:Turn_Camera_"
"Right@Adventure>\r\n"
"in order to keep track of the red balloon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "(...Is he lost? A kid that age shouldn't be wandering around town alone.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Waaah! My... My balloon flew away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "What's the matter, little guy? Are you lost?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"Muh... My balloon... *sniffle* It flew away...\r\n"
"And if I don't have it... I'll never see my mommy again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Why do you need a balloon to see your mom?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Oh, is that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Mommy said that if I had a red balloon, she could always\r\n"
"find me, even if I was really lost... And... and... *sniffle*\r\n"
"Waaaauuuhhh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "(So he needs his red balloon to reunite with his mother...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"Stop crying and start acting your age. I'm sure your mother will get you "
"another one if you behave like a good boy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "WAAAAAAAAHHH! I want my mommy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"All right. I'll tell you what, I'll get that balloon for you\r\n"
"if you dry those tears and stay strong. Can you do that for\r\n"
"me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "*sniffle* Okay... You really think you can find my balloon, mister?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"You bet. Wait right here and I'll have it back to you in\r\n"
"no time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr ""

