"the<Action:Turn_Camera_Up@Adventure><Action:Turn_Camera_"
"Down@Adventure><Action:Turn_Camera_Left@Adventure><Action:Turn_Camera_"
"Right@Adventure>\r\n"
"in order to keep track of the red balloon."
msgstr ""

